{{Quote|What kind of ship is this anyway?''"<br />"''Looks like a modified ''Omicron''-class attack shuttle.|Two [[clone trooper]]s comment on the ''Marauder''|<ref name="Cut and Run" />}}
The '''''Omicron''-class attack shuttle''',<ref name="Cut and Run" /> also known as an '''''Omicron''-class shuttle''',<ref name="Master of Evil">''[[Master of Evil]]''</ref>, '''''Omicron''-class gunship'''<ref name="SW DOR:TVG">''[[Star Wars: Dawn of Rebellion: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> or simply, the '''Omicron'''<ref name="DeAgo SWE:RASS">{{EncyclopediaCite|Republic and Separatist Ships (2)}}</ref> was a class of attack [[shuttle]] that was active during the [[Clone Wars]]. The [[Marauder (Omicron-class)|''Marauder'']], the [[starship]] of the [[Galactic Republic]]'s [[Clone Force 99]], was a modified ''Omicron''-class attack shuttle.<ref name="Databank" /><ref name="Cut and Run" /> [[Halland Goth]] and [[TC-99]] would later pilot one to visit the [[Diso system]].<ref name="Master of Evil" />

